{"unit_id":"yuqingsh__dsh-image-subagent#card-zh","repo":"yuqingsh/dsh-image-subagent","commit":"289fdd85a94484ee938d15a497e5e0161d774702","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-subagent（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：让纯文本主模型也能接收会话中的图片附件。它通过 DSH 的 LLM 服务桥接和流事件处理图片内容，将图片块转换成包含完整附件标识和对象路径提示的文本占位符，并让主模型把附件交给具备视觉能力的子代理读取。主要功能包括放行纯文本模型的图片准入、为主循环请求投影图片占位、为直接流调用提供补充投影，以及提供本机状态诊断端点。适合在主模型不支持图像输入、但需要借助视觉子代理理解图片的 Web 会话中使用。需要配置视觉子代理及其 read_image 工具，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:34-50","index.js:83-102","index.js:146-183","index.js:188-214"]}
{"unit_id":"yuqingsh__dsh-image-subagent#card-en","repo":"yuqingsh/dsh-image-subagent","commit":"289fdd85a94484ee938d15a497e5e0161d774702","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-image-subagent is a DSH Web plugin for text only models receiving session images. It converts images into placeholders with attachment IDs and paths, letting a vision subagent inspect them. It bridges model calls and provides a local status endpoint. Configure a vision subagent with read_image.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:34-50","index.js:83-102","index.js:146-183","index.js:188-214"]}
