{"unit_id":"yuqingsh__dsh-image-subagent#feature-1","repo":"yuqingsh/dsh-image-subagent","commit":"289fdd85a94484ee938d15a497e5e0161d774702","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-subagent 的功能「纯文本路由图片占位」：把会话消息中的图片块转换为含附件元数据、完整 ID 和对象路径提示的文本。模型请求经过桥接时自动触发，产出可供视觉子代理定位附件的占位内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:38-67","index.js:131-143"]}
{"unit_id":"yuqingsh__dsh-image-subagent#feature-2","repo":"yuqingsh/dsh-image-subagent","commit":"289fdd85a94484ee938d15a497e5e0161d774702","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-subagent 的功能「LLM 服务桥接」：包装 DSH 的模型信息解析、预备调用和流式调用。模型信息解析会对明确不支持图片的纯文本路由省略模态声明，调用时再按真实模态将图片投影为占位文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:146-183"]}
{"unit_id":"yuqingsh__dsh-image-subagent#feature-3","repo":"yuqingsh/dsh-image-subagent","commit":"289fdd85a94484ee938d15a497e5e0161d774702","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-subagent 的功能「状态诊断」：Web 连接服务可通过本机 RPC 的 /image-subagent status 查询桥接后的模态声明与真实模态声明，返回状态对象，便于确认插件桥接是否生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:188-214"]}
